source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Turn every single-character shortcut on or off (WCAG 2.1.4). Modifier chords such as Mod+k, Escape, Enter and the arrows keep working

Usage: mxr keys single-keys [OPTIONS] <STATE>

Arguments:
  <STATE>  [possible values: on, off]

Options:
      --dry-run            Show the change; write nothing
      --client <CLIENT>    Only this client's keys [possible values: tui, web]
      --context <CONTEXT>  Only keys live in this place: a TUI context or web scope, such as todo
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
